      <title>共享摄像头摊位不应继承前一个人的美颜滤镜</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%B4%E6%91%8A%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%8D%E5%BA%94%E7%BB%A7%E6%89%BF%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E7%BE%8E%E9%A2%9C%E6%BB%A4%E9%95%9C/</link>
